+msgid "##### Sparse SFA C8 cache transfer"
+msgstr "##### 稀疏 SFA C8 缓存传输"
+
+msgid ""
+"For SFA models, `MooncakeLayerwiseConnector` can transfer the contiguous "
+"packed C8 main cache directly. Attention writes the quantized NoPE data, "
+"BF16 RoPE data and dynamic scales before recording the cache-write event. "
+"The connector waits for that event and copies the bytes without applying the"
+" legacy K/V INT8 quantization again. Indexer K and its scale tensor are "
+"transferred as separate components of the same physical layer."
+msgstr ""
+"对于 SFA 模型，`MooncakeLayerwiseConnector` 可以直接传输连续的打包 C8 主缓存。Attention "
+"在记录缓存写入事件之前，会写入量化后的 NoPE 数据、BF16 RoPE 数据和动态 scale。连接器等待该事件，然后直接复制字节，不再应用旧版的 "
+"K/V INT8 量化。Indexer K 及其 scale 张量作为同一物理层的独立组件进行传输。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For FP8 main and indexer caches, configure both P and D with `--kv-cache-"
+"dtype fp8 --attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8`. Both ends must use "
+"matching cache layouts. This path requires main and indexer components to "
+"share one KV cache group with the same block-size scale. Noncontiguous "
+"packed main caches, TurboQuant, and DCP-replicated indexer layouts with "
+"different component block-size scales remain unsupported."
+msgstr ""
+"对于 FP8 主缓存和 indexer 缓存，需要在 P 端和 D 端都配置 `--kv-cache-dtype fp8 "
+"--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype fp8`。两端必须使用匹配的缓存布局。此路径要求主缓存组件和 indexer "
+"组件共享同一个 KV cache 组，并具有相同的 block-size scale。非连续的打包主缓存、TurboQuant，以及组件 block-"
+"size scale 不同的 DCP 复制 indexer 布局仍不受支持。"
+
+msgid ""
+"This transfer path still requires end-to-end validation on Ascend hardware, "
+"including configurations that combine it with `AscendStoreConnector` through"
+" `MultiConnector`."
+msgstr ""
+"此传输路径仍需在昇腾硬件上进行端到端验证，包括通过 `MultiConnector` 将其与 `AscendStoreConnector` "
+"组合使用的配置。"
