+msgid "### Fused Copy-SFA Operators"
+msgstr "### 融合 Copy-SFA 算子"
+
+msgid ""
+"Decode sparse offload uses fused LIM and Copy-SFA by default. The Python integration requires\n"
+"these operators in the installed `_C_ascend` extension:"
+msgstr ""
+"Decode 稀疏卸载默认使用融合 LIM 和 Copy-SFA。Python 集成要求\n"
+"已安装的 `_C_ascend` 扩展中包含这些算子："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `npu_fused_lightning_indexer_manage`\n"
+"- `npu_fused_quant_lightning_indexer_manage` (LIM C8)\n"
+"- `npu_fused_scatter_copy_sparse_flash_attention`"
+msgstr ""
+"- `npu_fused_lightning_indexer_manage`\n"
+"- `npu_fused_quant_lightning_indexer_manage` (LIM C8)\n"
+"- `npu_fused_scatter_copy_sparse_flash_attention`"
+
+msgid ""
+"The repository includes the native kernels, PyTorch bindings, and Python\n"
+"integration for fused LIM and Copy-SFA. The installed build must include these\n"
+"operators to run sparse Decode offload; the presence of Python source alone\n"
+"is not sufficient."
+msgstr ""
+"仓库中包含融合 LIM 和 Copy-SFA 的原生内核、PyTorch 绑定以及 Python\n"
+"集成。已安装的构建必须包含这些\n"
+"算子才能运行稀疏 Decode 卸载；仅有 Python 源码\n"
+"是不够的。"
+
+msgid ""
+"LIM C8 uses `npu_fused_quant_lightning_indexer_manage`, which is included on\n"
+"this branch. Enable it with `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8`. The\n"
+"indexer then Hadamard-rotates and int8-quantizes query and key, and\n"
+"`_lim_select` forwards that int8 query and the fp16 dequant scales to the C8\n"
+"LIM. The 19-parameter management ABI matches BF16 LIM, so Copy-SFA and miss H2D\n"
+"stay unchanged. The C8 kernel is int8-only; `indexer_kv_dtype fp8` is not a\n"
+"LIM C8 serving path."
+msgstr ""
+"LIM C8 使用 `npu_fused_quant_lightning_indexer_manage`，该算子已包含在\n"
+"本分支中。通过 `--attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8` 启用它。\n"
+"随后 indexer 会对 query 和 key 进行 Hadamard 旋转和 int8 量化，\n"
+"`_lim_select` 将该 int8 query 和 fp16 反量化缩放因子转发给 C8\n"
+"LIM。19 参数管理 ABI 与 BF16 LIM 一致，因此 Copy-SFA 和 miss H2D\n"
+"保持不变。C8 内核仅支持 int8；`indexer_kv_dtype fp8` 不是\n"
+"LIM C8 的服务路径。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Copy-SFA receives `dram_k_rope` and `dram_kv_cache` as CPU tensor views backed\n"
+"by registered MemFabric memory. The native adapter accepts these registered\n"
+"host views. The remaining inputs stay on NPU. Ordinary CPU allocations are not\n"
+"valid replacements for registered DRAM, and the Python integration does not\n"
+"move the host cache to NPU."
+msgstr ""
+"Copy-SFA 接收 `dram_k_rope` 和 `dram_kv_cache` 作为由已注册 MemFabric 内存\n"
+"支撑的 CPU 张量视图。原生适配器接受这些已注册的\n"
+"主机视图。其余输入保留在 NPU 上。普通 CPU 分配不能\n"
+"替代已注册的 DRAM，并且 Python 集成不会\n"
+"将主机缓存移动到 NPU。"
 
 msgid ""
+"After Decode processes a readiness notification, it replies with `READ_DONE` or\n"
+"`READ_FAILED`. A reported MemFabric read failure invalidates the Decode\n"
+"destination and releases the Prefill-side waiter with an error, preventing\n"
+"silent corruption. The initial `MF_META` handshake has a 100-second timeout\n"
+"and raises an error if Decode does not reply. The per-layer read-completion\n"
+"gate is separate: it checks for reported errors and a stopped sender thread,\n"
+"but has no overall deadline. If a layer acknowledgement is lost while the\n"
+"sender thread remains alive, Prefill may continue waiting."
+msgstr ""
+"Decode 处理就绪通知后，会回复 `READ_DONE` 或\n"
+"`READ_FAILED`。上报的 MemFabric 读取失败会使 Decode\n"
+"目标失效，并以错误释放 Prefill 侧的等待者，从而防止\n"
+"静默损坏。初始 `MF_META` 握手有 100 秒超时，\n"
+"如果 Decode 未回复则抛出错误。逐层读取完成\n"
+"门控是独立的：它检查上报的错误和已停止的发送线程，\n"
+"但没有整体截止时间。如果某一层的确认丢失而\n"
+"发送线程仍然存活，Prefill 可能会继续等待。"
+
