-msgid ""
-"- `--language-model-only` (optional): For text-only tests, add this flag as needed based on the available KV cache capacity to avoid reserving memory for multimodal processing.\n"
-"- `\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\"` (optional, omitted by default): Limits the maximum decode batch size covered by ACL graph capture and the graph memory reserved for it; the program default is `512`. With EAGLE3 speculative decoding, each request is expanded to `1 + num_speculative_tokens` tokens in one decode step (`4` tokens when `num_speculative_tokens=3`). Since DP distributes requests per rank, the per-rank batch size matters: for example, with `DP2` and `--max-num-seqs 256`, each DP rank handles 128 requests, producing `4 × 128 = 512` tokens per step — exactly at the default limit. If concurrency rises to 257, one DP rank handles 129 requests, giving `4 × 129 = 516 > 512`; batches above 512 skip graph capture and fall back to eager execution, lowering decode throughput. In that case set `\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024` in `--compilation-config` (e.g., `--compilation-config '{\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024}'`). Because a larger capture size reserves additional NPU memory, the configurations in this tutorial keep the default; add this option only when your target concurrency requires it.\n"
-"- `--max-num-seqs 256`: Decode concurrency used by the verified 950DT products 1P1D launch. A3 uses `128`."
-msgstr ""
-"- `--language-model-only`（可选）：对于纯文本测试，根据可用的 KV cache 容量按需添加此标志，以避免为多模态处理预留内存。\n"
-"- `\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\"`（可选，默认省略）：限制 ACL 图捕获所覆盖的最大 decode 批大小以及为其预留的图内存；程序默认为 `512`。使用 EAGLE3 投机解码时，每个请求在一个 decode 步骤中扩展为 `1 + num_speculative_tokens` 个 token（当 `num_speculative_tokens=3` 时为 `4` 个 token）。由于 DP 按 rank 分发请求，每个 rank 的批大小很关键：例如，使用 `DP2` 和 `--max-num-seqs 256` 时，每个 DP rank 处理 128 个请求，每步产生 `4 × 128 = 512` 个 token——恰好达到默认上限。如果并发升至 257，一个 DP rank 处理 129 个请求，得到 `4 × 129 = 516 > 512`；超过 512 的批次会跳过图捕获并回退到 eager 执行，从而降低 decode 吞吐。此时请在 `--compilation-config` 中设置 `\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024`（例如 `--compilation-config '{\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024}'`）。由于更大的捕获大小会预留额外的 NPU 内存，本教程中的配置保持默认值；仅当目标并发需要时才添加此选项。\n"
-"- `--max-num-seqs 256`：经验证的 Ascend 950DT系列产品 1P1D 启动所使用的 Decode 并发数。A3 使用 `128`。"
