+"that JSON."
 msgstr ""
-"从第 5.3 节的环境块开始（`HCCL_IF_IP`、`HCCL`/`GLOO`/`TP` socket "
-"IFNAME、`HCCL_BUFFSIZE`、`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE`、`PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF`、`ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES`，以及"
-" A3 Prefill `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"16,15,15,14\"`）。然后添加下面 pooling "
-"所需的环境变量。根据你的机器和链路类型，从[环境变量说明](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)中选择硬件/通信相关的导出项。"
+"`--speculative-config` 示例使用单引号 JSON。`'\"${EAGLE3_WEIGHT_PATH}\"'` 片段会在该 JSON"
+" 中展开草稿权重路径。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Single-node deployment completes both Prefill and Decode within the same "
+"node. The MiniMax-M3 (BF16) model can be deployed on 1 Atlas 800I A3 (64GB ×"
+" 16), but dual-node deployment is recommended for BF16 on A3 series; single-"
+"node is not recommended. The MiniMax-M3-w8a8 (W8A8) quantized model is "
+"recommended for single-node deployment on 1 Atlas 800I A3 (64GB × 16) or 1 "
+"Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × 8). The MiniMax-M3-MXFP8 (MXFP8) quantized model can be"
+" deployed on 1 950DT products (96GB × 8)."
+msgstr ""
+"单节点部署在同一节点内完成 Prefill 和 Decode。MiniMax-M3（BF16）模型可部署在 1 个 Atlas 800I A3（64GB"
+" × 16）上，但 A3 系列上的 BF16 推荐双节点部署；不建议单节点部署。MiniMax-M3-w8a8（W8A8）量化模型推荐单节点部署在 1 "
+"个 Atlas 800I A3（64GB × 16）或 1 个 Atlas 800 A2（64GB × "
+"8）上。MiniMax-M3-MXFP8（MXFP8）量化模型可部署在 1 个 Ascend 950DT系列产品（96GB × 8）上。"
+
+msgid "=== \"A3 series (BF16)\""
+msgstr "=== \"A3 系列（BF16）\""
+
+msgid "=== \"A3 series (W8A8)\""
+msgstr "=== \"A3 系列（W8A8）\""
+
+msgid ""
+"Deploying the float model on Ascend A2 servers requires at least two nodes. "
+"Multi-node deployment on A3 servers without prefill–decode disaggregation is"
+" not recommended. Update `WEIGHT_PATH`, `EAGLE3_WEIGHT_PATH`, `LOG_PATH`, "
+"`local_ip`, `node0_ip`, and `NETWORK_INTERFACE` based on the actual "
+"environment. Set `NETWORK_INTERFACE` to the local communication NIC name "
+"(for example, `eth0`); HCCL and Gloo use this value directly."
+msgstr ""
+"在昇腾 A2 服务器上部署浮点模型至少需要两个节点。不建议在 A3 服务器上进行未启用 Prefill-Decode "
+"分离的多节点部署。请根据实际环境更新 "
+"`WEIGHT_PATH`、`EAGLE3_WEIGHT_PATH`、`LOG_PATH`、`local_ip`、`node0_ip` 和 "
+"`NETWORK_INTERFACE`。将 `NETWORK_INTERFACE` 设置为本地通信网卡名称（例如 `eth0`）；HCCL 和 Gloo"
+" 直接使用该值。"
+
+msgid "### 5.3 Sub-1M-Token Context Deployment"
+msgstr "### 5.3 低于 1M Token 上下文部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"The following PD examples cover contexts below 1M tokens and use `--max-"
+"model-len 133000`. Choose ordinary PD or add a KV cache pool with the same "
+"serving topology. For the separate 1M-context configurations, see [Section "
+"5.4](#54-1m-token-context-deployment)."
+msgstr ""
+"以下 PD 示例涵盖低于 1M token 的上下文，并使用 `--max-model-len 133000`。可选择普通 PD "
+"或添加具有相同服务拓扑的 KV cache 池。关于单独的 1M 上下文配置，请参见[第 5.4 节](#54-1m-token-context-"
+"deployment)。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.3.1 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation"
+msgstr "#### 5.3.1 Prefill-Decode 分离部署"
+
+msgid ""
+"This section deploys MiniMax-M3 PD disaggregation as 1P1D: on Atlas 800I A3 "
+"it spans three nodes (one Prefill node and two Decode nodes); on 950DT it "
+"runs on two nodes, and the 950DT example below also describes scaling the "
+"same 1P1D deployment to three nodes. Here, 1P1D means one Prefill service "
+"group and one Decode service group. The Decode group can span two machines "
+"while remaining one global DP group."
+msgstr ""
+"本节将 MiniMax-M3 PD 分离部署为 1P1D：在 Atlas 800I A3 上跨三个节点（一个 Prefill 节点和两个 Decode "
+"节点）；在 950DT 上运行于两个节点，下面的 950DT 示例还描述了将相同的 1P1D 部署扩展到三个节点。此处 1P1D 表示一个 "
+"Prefill 服务组和一个 Decode 服务组。Decode 组可跨两台机器，同时仍为一个全局 DP 组。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The templates use named environment variables instead of positional shell "
+"arguments. Replace the `<...>` IP, NIC and weight-path placeholders in each "
+"template, or export those variables in the shell before launching. The "
+"numeric defaults below describe one engine; `launch_online_dp.py` overrides "
+"the per-rank values when it starts all local engines. You do not need to "
+"calculate a different port or device list for every rank. When using the "
+"launcher, edit `export DP_SIZE=...`, `export TP_SIZE=...`, `export "
+"PP_SIZE=...` and the other values in the node-specific launch block; these "
+"take precedence over the `${VARIABLE:-default}` values in the template."
+msgstr ""
+"模板使用命名环境变量而非位置 shell 参数。请替换每个模板中的 `<...>` IP、网卡和权重路径占位符，或在启动前在 shell "
+"中导出这些变量。下面的数值默认值描述单个引擎；`launch_online_dp.py` 在启动所有本地引擎时会覆盖每个 rank 的值。您无需为每个 "
+"rank 计算不同的端口或设备列表。使用启动器时，请编辑节点特定启动块中的 `export DP_SIZE=...`、`export "
+"TP_SIZE=...`、`export PP_SIZE=...` 及其他值；这些值优先于模板中的 `${VARIABLE:-default}` 值。"
+
+msgid "| Variable | Meaning | How it is set |"
+msgstr "| 变量 | 含义 | 设置方式 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `LOCAL_IP` | Current node's communication IP | Fill in `<CURRENT_NODE_IP>`"
+" separately on each node. |"
+msgstr "| `LOCAL_IP` | 当前节点的通信 IP | 在每个节点上分别填写 `<CURRENT_NODE_IP>`。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `NIC_NAME` | NIC associated with `LOCAL_IP` | Fill in "
+"`<CURRENT_NODE_NIC>`. |"
+msgstr "| `NIC_NAME` | 与 `LOCAL_IP` 关联的网卡 | 填写 `<CURRENT_NODE_NIC>`。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `MODEL_PATH` / `EAGLE3_WEIGHT_PATH` | Target / draft weight directories | "
+"Use the same mounted paths on every node. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `MODEL_PATH` / `EAGLE3_WEIGHT_PATH` | 目标 / 草稿权重目录 | 在每个节点上使用相同的挂载路径。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `DP_SIZE` / `TP_SIZE` / `PP_SIZE` | Global DP size / TP and PP size within"
+" one rank | Numeric values are exported in each launch command below. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `DP_SIZE` / `TP_SIZE` / `PP_SIZE` | 全局 DP 大小 / 单个 rank 内的 TP 和 PP 大小 | "
+"数值在下面的每个启动命令中导出。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `LOCAL_DP_SIZE` | Number of engines on the current node | Passed to the "
+"launcher as `--dp-size-local`. |"
+msgstr "| `LOCAL_DP_SIZE` | 当前节点上的引擎数量 | 作为 `--dp-size-local` 传递给启动器。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `DP_RANK_START` | First global DP rank on this node | Passed as `--dp-"
+"rank-start`; differs between the two Decode nodes. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `DP_RANK_START` | 此节点上的第一个全局 DP rank | 作为 `--dp-rank-start` 传递；两个 Decode "
+"节点之间不同。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `DP_ADDRESS` | DP coordinator IP for this role | Prefill's IP for P; the "
+"first Decode node's IP for every D node. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `DP_ADDRESS` | 此角色的 DP 协调器 IP | P 使用 Prefill 的 IP；每个 D 节点使用第一个 Decode 节点的 "
+"IP。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `DP_RPC_PORT` | DP coordinator port | All nodes in the same role use the "
+"same value. |"
+msgstr "| `DP_RPC_PORT` | DP 协调器端口 | 同一角色中的所有节点使用相同的值。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `SERVICE_PORT` | First local API port in the launch shell | The launcher "
+"adds the local rank index for each engine. |"
+msgstr "| `SERVICE_PORT` | 启动 shell 中的第一个本地 API 端口 | 启动器为每个引擎加上本地 rank 索引。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `DP_RANK` | Engine's global DP rank | The launcher sets `DP_RANK_START + "
+"local_rank`. |"
+msgstr "| `DP_RANK` | 引擎的全局 DP rank | 启动器设置 `DP_RANK_START + local_rank`。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `VISIBLE_DEVICES` | NPU IDs for one engine | The launcher assigns `TP_SIZE"
+" × PP_SIZE` consecutive IDs per local rank. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| `VISIBLE_DEVICES` | 单个引擎的 NPU ID | 启动器为每个本地 rank 分配 `TP_SIZE × PP_SIZE` "
+"个连续 ID。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"Save the Prefill template as `run_dp_template.sh` on the P node and the "
+"Decode template under that name on each D node. Run the launcher from the "
+"directory containing the matching template. If using a shared filesystem, "
+"keep P and D templates in separate directories. Changing TP/DP/PP also "
+"requires updating the matching `prefill` and `decode` layouts in both roles'"
+" `--kv-transfer-config`."
+msgstr ""
+"将 Prefill 模板保存为 P 节点上的 `run_dp_template.sh`，并将 Decode 模板以该名称保存到每个 D "
+"节点上。从包含匹配模板的目录运行启动器。如果使用共享文件系统，请将 P 和 D 模板放在不同目录中。更改 TP/DP/PP 还需要更新两个角色的 "
+"`--kv-transfer-config` 中匹配的 `prefill` 和 `decode` 布局。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The following values match the configurations in Sections 5.3.1 and 5.3.2. "
+"P/D node counts refer to machines; `DP_SIZE` is the global number of ranks "
+"for that role."
+msgstr ""
+"以下数值与第 5.3.1 节和第 5.3.2 节中的配置相匹配。P/D 节点数指机器数量；`DP_SIZE` 是该角色的全局 rank 数量。"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Section / platform | Role / node | `DP_SIZE` | `TP_SIZE` | `PP_SIZE` | "
+"`LOCAL_DP_SIZE` | `DP_RANK_START` | First `SERVICE_PORT` |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 章节 / 平台 | 角色 / 节点 | `DP_SIZE` | `TP_SIZE` | `PP_SIZE` | `LOCAL_DP_SIZE` | "
+"`DP_RANK_START` | 首个 `SERVICE_PORT` |"
+
+msgid "| 5.3.1 A3, three nodes | P | 1 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 0 | 31050 |"
+msgstr "| 5.3.1 A3，三节点 | P | 1 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 0 | 31050 |"
+
+msgid "| 5.3.1 A3, three nodes | First D | 8 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 0 | 31260 |"
+msgstr "| 5.3.1 A3，三节点 | 第一个 D | 8 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 0 | 31260 |"
+
+msgid "| 5.3.1 A3, three nodes | Second D | 8 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 4 | 31260 |"
+msgstr "| 5.3.1 A3，三节点 | 第二个 D | 8 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 4 | 31260 |"
+
+msgid "| 5.3.1 950DT, two nodes | P | 2 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 0 | 31050 |"
+msgstr "| 5.3.1 950DT，两节点 | P | 2 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 0 | 31050 |"
+
+msgid "| 5.3.1 950DT, two nodes | D | 2 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 0 | 31060 |"
+msgstr "| 5.3.1 950DT，两节点 | D | 2 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 0 | 31060 |"
+
+msgid "| 5.3.1 950DT, three nodes | P | 2 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 0 | 31050 |"
+msgstr "| 5.3.1 950DT，三节点 | P | 2 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 0 | 31050 |"
+
+msgid "| 5.3.1 950DT, three nodes | First D | 4 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 0 | 31060 |"
+msgstr "| 5.3.1 950DT，三节点 | 第一个 D | 4 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 0 | 31060 |"
+
+msgid "| 5.3.1 950DT, three nodes | Second D | 4 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 2 | 31062 |"
+msgstr "| 5.3.1 950DT，三节点 | 第二个 D | 4 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 2 | 31062 |"
+
+msgid "| 5.3.2 A3, three nodes | P | 1 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 0 | 31050 |"
+msgstr "| 5.3.2 A3，三节点 | P | 1 | 4 | 4 | 1 | 0 | 31050 |"
+
+msgid "| 5.3.2 A3, three nodes | First D | 8 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 0 | 31260 |"
+msgstr "| 5.3.2 A3，三节点 | 第一个 D | 8 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 0 | 31260 |"
+
+msgid "| 5.3.2 A3, three nodes | Second D | 8 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 4 | 31260 |"
+msgstr "| 5.3.2 A3，三节点 | 第二个 D | 8 | 4 | 1 | 4 | 4 | 31260 |"
+
+msgid "| 5.3.2 950DT, two nodes | P | 2 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 0 | 31050 |"
+msgstr "| 5.3.2 950DT，两节点 | P | 2 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 0 | 31050 |"
+
+msgid "| 5.3.2 950DT, two nodes | D | 2 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 0 | 31060 |"
+msgstr "| 5.3.2 950DT，两节点 | D | 2 | 4 | 1 | 2 | 0 | 31060 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"Prefill-Decode disaggregation can be deployed on 3 Atlas 800I A3 (64GB × 24)"
+" for `MiniMax-M3-w8a8` (W8A8) with `MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA`."
+msgstr ""
+"Prefill-Decode 分离部署可在 3 台 Atlas 800I A3（64GB × 24）上部署 "
+"`MiniMax-M3-w8a8`（W8A8），并搭配 `MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For short-input workloads, tune `--max-num-batched-tokens` using [Section 9.2](#92-tuning-guidelines).\n"
+"    Once the preparation is done, start the server with the following command on each node:"
+msgstr ""
+"对于短输入负载，请参考[第 9.2 节](#92-tuning-guidelines)调整 `--max-num-batched-tokens`。\n"
+"    准备完成后，在每个节点上使用以下命令启动服务："
+
+msgid "2. First Decode node (`DECODE0_IP`, global ranks 0–3)"
+msgstr "2. 第一个 Decode 节点（`DECODE0_IP`，全局 rank 0–3）"
+
+msgid "3. Second Decode node (`DECODE1_IP`, global ranks 4–7)"
+msgstr "3. 第二个 Decode 节点（`DECODE1_IP`，全局 rank 4–7）"
+
+msgid ""
+"Set `LOCAL_IP` and `NIC_NAME` in the Decode template for each node "
+"separately. Both Decode nodes use `DECODE0_IP` as the DP coordinator "
+"address. Each node exposes API ports `31260` through `31263`; wait for all "
+"eight DP ranks to print `Application startup complete`."
+msgstr ""
+"请分别为每个节点在 Decode 模板中设置 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME`。两个 Decode 节点均使用 `DECODE0_IP` "
+"作为 DP 协调器地址。每个节点对外暴露 API 端口 `31260` 至 `31263`；请等待全部八个 DP rank 打印 "
+"`Application startup complete`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"To set up request forwarding, run the following script on a node that can "
+"reach every Prefill and Decode API port. You can get the proxy program in "
+"the repository's examples: "
+"[load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
+"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)."
+" For A3 1P1D, the proxy forwards requests to one Prefill node and eight DP "
+"ranks across three nodes."
+msgstr ""
+"要设置请求转发，请在一台能够访问所有 Prefill 和 Decode API 端口的节点上运行以下脚本。代理程序可在仓库的 examples "
+"目录中获取：[load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
+"project/vllm-"
+"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)。对于"
+" A3 1P1D，代理会将请求转发到一个 Prefill 节点以及跨三个节点的八个 DP rank。"
+
+msgid ""
+"To use MindIE PyMotor instead of the example proxy, follow [Deploy vLLM-"
+"Ascend with MindIE-"
+"Motor](../../user_guide/deployment_guide/using_mindie_motor.md) and register"
+" the same one Prefill and eight Decode endpoints. Send benchmark requests to"
+" the Motor inference endpoint. Changing the request router does not require "
+"changing the P/D parallel sizes or scheduler limits above."
+msgstr ""
+"如需使用 MindIE PyMotor 替代示例代理，请参考[使用 MindIE-Motor 部署 vLLM-"
+"Ascend](../../user_guide/deployment_guide/using_mindie_motor.md)，并注册相同的一个 "
+"Prefill 和八个 Decode 端点。将基准测试请求发送到 Motor 推理端点。更换请求路由器无需更改上述 P/D 并行规格或调度器限制。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Prefill-Decode disaggregation can be deployed on two 950DT nodes (96GB × 8, "
+"1P1D) for `MiniMax-M3-MXFP8` with `MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA`, and scales to "
+"three nodes while remaining 1P1D (one Prefill service group and one Decode "
+"service group; see below). On SuperPod systems (UB fabric), export "
+"`ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES='{\"version\":\"1.3\"}'` as in the templates below; "
+"mounting `/etc/hixlep/` applies to RoCE-attached 950DT instead. The examples"
+" explicitly enable Model Runner V2."
+msgstr ""
+"Prefill-Decode 分离部署可在两台 950DT 节点（96GB × 8，1P1D）上部署 `MiniMax-M3-MXFP8`，并搭配 "
+"`MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA`，且可扩展至三节点同时保持 1P1D（一个 Prefill 服务组和一个 Decode "
+"服务组；见下文）。在 SuperPod 系统（UB 网络）上，请按下文模板导出 "
+"`ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES='{\"version\":\"1.3\"}'`；挂载 `/etc/hixlep/` 则适用于通过 "
+"RoCE 连接的 950DT。示例中显式启用了 Model Runner V2。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Set `PREFILL_IP` and `DECODE_IP` to the Prefill and Decode communication "
+"IPs. For the three-node variant, also set `DECODE0_IP` and `DECODE1_IP`. Set"
+" `LOCAL_IP` and `NIC_NAME` separately in each node's template."
+msgstr ""
+"将 `PREFILL_IP` 和 `DECODE_IP` 设置为 Prefill 和 Decode 的通信 IP。对于三节点变体，还需设置 "
+"`DECODE0_IP` 和 `DECODE1_IP`。请在每个节点的模板中分别设置 `LOCAL_IP` 和 `NIC_NAME`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"To set up request forwarding, run the following script on a node that can "
+"reach every Prefill and Decode API port. You can get the proxy program in "
+"the repository's examples: "
+"[load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-"
+"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)."
+" For 950DT products 1P1D, the proxy forwards requests to 2 Prefill ranks and"
+" 2 DP ranks."
+msgstr ""
+"要设置请求转发，请在一台能够访问所有 Prefill 和 Decode API 端口的节点上运行以下脚本。代理程序可在仓库的 examples "
+"目录中获取：[load_balance_proxy_server_example.py](https://github.com/vllm-"
+"project/vllm-"
+"ascend/blob/main/examples/disaggregated_prefill_v1/load_balance_proxy_server_example.py)。对于"
+" 950DT 产品 1P1D，代理会将请求转发到 2 个 Prefill rank 和 2 个 DP rank。"
+
+msgid "**Scaling to three nodes (still 1P1D)**"
+msgstr "**扩展至三节点（仍为 1P1D）**"
+
+msgid ""
+"The deployment above scales to three nodes: one Prefill node (DP2 × TP4) "
+"plus two Decode nodes forming one global DP4 group (two local DP ranks per "
+"Decode node, TP4 each; 24 NPUs in total). Only one template change is "
+"required: in **both** the Prefill and Decode `run_dp_template.sh`, update "
+"the Mooncake extra config to describe the new Decode group — "
+"`\"decode\":{\"dp_size\":4,\"tp_size\":4,\"pp_size\":1}` (Prefill stays "
+"`dp_size: 2`). Also set `LOCAL_IP` in each node's template to that node's "
+"compute-network IP."
+msgstr ""
+"上述部署可扩展至三节点：一个 Prefill 节点（DP2 × TP4）加上两个 Decode 节点组成一个全局 DP4 组（每个 Decode "
+"节点有两个本地 DP rank，各为 TP4；共 24 个 NPU）。只需修改一处模板：在 Prefill 和 Decode 的 "
+"`run_dp_template.sh` **两者**中，更新 Mooncake 额外配置以描述新的 Decode 组 —— "
+"`\"decode\":{\"dp_size\":4,\"tp_size\":4,\"pp_size\":1}`（Prefill 保持 "
+"`dp_size: 2`）。同时将每个节点模板中的 `LOCAL_IP` 设置为该节点的计算网络 IP。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Start the Prefill node exactly as in the two-node example. Then start the "
+"first Decode node (`DECODE0_IP`, global DP ranks 0–1), which also acts as "
+"the DP group master:"
+msgstr ""
+"完全按照两节点示例启动 Prefill 节点。然后启动第一个 Decode 节点（`DECODE0_IP`，全局 DP rank "
+"0–1），该节点同时充当 DP 组主节点："
+
+msgid ""
+"Wait for rank 0 to print `Started DP Coordinator process`. From another "
+"shell, start the second Decode node (`DECODE1_IP`, global DP ranks 2–3), "
+"which joins the same DP group:"
+msgstr ""
+"等待 rank 0 打印 `Started DP Coordinator process`。在另一个 shell 中，启动第二个 Decode "
+"节点（`DECODE1_IP`，全局 DP rank 2–3），该节点将加入同一个 DP 组："
+
+msgid ""
+"The first Decode node serves API ports `31060`/`31061` and the second "
+"`31062`/`31063`. Wait until all four DP ranks print `Application startup "
+"complete`. The template base `kv_port` (`26900`) and `engine_id` (`\"1\"`) "
+"can remain the same on both Decode nodes. Keep the global DP ranks distinct "
+"(0–1 and 2–3); Mooncake derives handshake ports using the global DP-rank "
+"offset. Start the proxy only after all six engines are up (the example proxy"
+" waits only a few seconds per backend), registering two Prefill ranks and "
+"four DP ranks:"
+msgstr ""
+"第一个 Decode 节点提供 API 端口 `31060`/`31061`，第二个提供 `31062`/`31063`。请等待全部四个 DP rank"
+" 打印 `Application startup complete`。模板基础 `kv_port`（`26900`）和 "
+"`engine_id`（`\"1\"`）在两个 Decode 节点上可保持一致。请保持全局 DP rank 互不相同（0–1 和 "
+"2–3）；Mooncake 使用全局 DP rank 偏移量推导握手端口。请在所有六个引擎启动后再启动代理（示例代理对每个后端仅等待几秒钟），并注册两个"
+" Prefill rank 和四个 DP rank："
+
+msgid ""
+"In a contributor-verified text-only run using this three-node layout with "
+"MXFP8, EAGLE3, fp8 KV cache and the optional `--language-model-only` flag, "
+"all 232 requests succeeded at 128k input / 1k output and concurrency 58. "
+"Average TPOT was 27.3 ms and aggregate output throughput was about 1840 "
+"tokens/s. In that setup, enabling Decode FlashComm1 increased output "
+"throughput from 1807.9 to 1840.7 tokens/s (about 1.8%). These measurements "
+"describe that workload and configuration; the launch templates leave "
+"`--language-model-only` optional."
+msgstr ""
+"在贡献者验证的纯文本运行中，使用此三节点布局并启用 MXFP8、EAGLE3、fp8 KV cache 以及可选的 `--language-model-"
+"only` 标志，全部 232 个请求在 128k 输入 / 1k 输出、并发 58 的情况下均成功完成。平均 TPOT 为 27.3 "
+"ms，总输出吞吐量约为 1840 tokens/s。在该设置中，启用 Decode FlashComm1 将输出吞吐量从 1807.9 提升至 "
+"1840.7 tokens/s（约 1.8%）。这些测量结果描述的是该工作负载和配置；启动模板将 `--language-model-only` "
+"保留为可选。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `--language-model-only` (optional): For text-only tests, add this flag as needed based on the available KV cache capacity to avoid reserving memory for multimodal processing. This flag can be used together with FLASHCOMM1 for text-only serving.\n"
+"- `--pipeline-parallel-size` (A3 Prefill: `4`): Splits the 60 MiniMax-M3 layers across four pipeline stages. A3 sets `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=16,15,15,14` and also writes `pp_layer_partition` into the Mooncake extra config. With `TP=4`, use `DP=1` to fit all four stages on one 16-NPU node. The 950DT products launch uses `--pp-size 1` on both Prefill and Decode (no pipeline parallel), so no layer partition is needed.\n"
+"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` (A3 Prefill: `8192`): For better prefill performance, use `8192` when the input length is at least 8192 tokens; for shorter inputs, set it to the input token length. This recommendation also applies to A3 Prefill with KV Cache Pool in Section 5.3.2.\n"
+"- `--enforce-eager`: Prefill nodes retain eager execution without graph capture.\n"
+"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`: Decode nodes and single-node mixed-serving examples on A3 and 950DT use full graph capture for decode-only batches.\n"
+"- `--speculative-config '{\"method\":\"eagle3\", ...}'`: Enables the `MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA` draft model. Do not replace this with GLM MTP options."
+msgstr ""
+"- `--language-model-only`（可选）：对于纯文本测试，根据可用的 KV cache 容量按需添加此标志，以避免为多模态处理预留内存。此标志可与 FLASHCOMM1 一起用于纯文本服务。\n"
+"- `--pipeline-parallel-size`（A3 Prefill：`4`）：将 60 层 MiniMax-M3 拆分到四个流水线阶段。A3 设置 `VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=16,15,15,14`，并将 `pp_layer_partition` 写入 Mooncake 额外配置。在 `TP=4` 时，使用 `DP=1` 可将全部四个阶段放在一个 16-NPU 节点上。Ascend 950DT系列产品的启动在 Prefill 和 Decode 上均使用 `--pp-size 1`（无流水线并行），因此无需层分区。\n"
+"- `--max-num-batched-tokens`（A3 Prefill：`8192`）：为获得更好的 prefill 性能，当输入长度至少为 8192 tokens 时使用 `8192`；对于更短的输入，将其设置为输入 token 长度。此建议同样适用于第 5.3.2 节中使用 KV Cache Pool 的 A3 Prefill。\n"
+"- `--enforce-eager`：Prefill 节点保留 eager 执行，不进行图捕获。\n"
+"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`：A3 和 950DT 上的 Decode 节点及单节点混合服务示例对仅解码批次使用完整图捕获。\n"
+"- `--speculative-config '{\"method\":\"eagle3\", ...}'`：启用 `MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA` 草稿模型。请勿将其替换为 GLM MTP 选项。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `--language-model-only` (optional): For text-only tests, add this flag as needed based on the available KV cache capacity to avoid reserving memory for multimodal processing.\n"
+"- `\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\"` (optional, omitted by default): Limits the maximum decode batch size covered by ACL graph capture and the graph memory reserved for it; the program default is `512`. With EAGLE3 speculative decoding, each request is expanded to `1 + num_speculative_tokens` tokens in one decode step (`4` tokens when `num_speculative_tokens=3`). Since DP distributes requests per rank, the per-rank batch size matters: for example, with `DP2` and `--max-num-seqs 256`, each DP rank handles 128 requests, producing `4 × 128 = 512` tokens per step — exactly at the default limit. If concurrency rises to 257, one DP rank handles 129 requests, giving `4 × 129 = 516 > 512`; batches above 512 skip graph capture and fall back to eager execution, lowering decode throughput. In that case set `\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024` in `--compilation-config` (e.g., `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\",\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024}'`). Because a larger capture size reserves additional NPU memory, the configurations in this tutorial keep the default; add this option only when your target concurrency requires it.\n"
+"- `--max-num-seqs 256`: Decode concurrency used by the verified 950DT products 1P1D launch. A3 uses `128`."
+msgstr ""
+"- `--language-model-only`（可选）：对于纯文本测试，根据可用的 KV cache 容量按需添加此标志，以避免为多模态处理预留内存。\n"
+"- `\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\"`（可选，默认省略）：限制 ACL 图捕获所覆盖的最大解码批次大小以及为其预留的图内存；程序默认值为 `512`。使用 EAGLE3 投机解码时，每个请求在一个解码步骤中扩展为 `1 + num_speculative_tokens` 个 tokens（当 `num_speculative_tokens=3` 时为 `4` 个 tokens）。由于 DP 按 rank 分发请求，每个 rank 的批次大小很重要：例如，使用 `DP2` 和 `--max-num-seqs 256` 时，每个 DP rank 处理 128 个请求，每步产生 `4 × 128 = 512` 个 tokens——恰好处于默认限制。如果并发升至 257，一个 DP rank 处理 129 个请求，得到 `4 × 129 = 516 > 512`；超过 512 的批次会跳过图捕获并回退到 eager 执行，从而降低解码吞吐量。在这种情况下，在 `--compilation-config` 中设置 `\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024`（例如 `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\",\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024}'`）。由于更大的捕获大小会预留额外的 NPU 内存，本教程中的配置保持默认值；仅当目标并发需要时才添加此选项。\n"
+"- `--max-num-seqs 256`：经验证的 Ascend 950DT系列产品 1P1D 启动所使用的 Decode 并发数。A3 使用 `128`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- `\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`: Uses Mooncake as the KV cache transfer connector between prefill and decode nodes.\n"
+"- `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"` / `\"kv_consumer\"`: `kv_producer` on prefill nodes, `kv_consumer` on decode nodes.\n"
+"- `\"kv_port\"`: Port for Mooncake KV transfer. Use different ports for prefill and decode. The verified values are A3 `36000`/`36100` and 950DT products `30000`/`26900`.\n"
+"- `\"use_ascend_direct\": true`: Enables Ascend direct transfer for KV cache.\n"
+"- `\"ascend_local_comm_res_path\": \"/etc/hixlep\"` (950DT products only): Used for RoCE-attached 950DT with `/etc/hixlep/` mounted. On SuperPod UB fabric, omit this option and export `ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES='{\"version\":\"1.3\"}'` instead, as in the Section 5.3.1 templates. The Section 5.3.2 950DT KV-pool templates retain the static-path setup; adapt the Mooncake connector inside the `MultiConnector` the same way when using UB fabric.\n"
+"- `\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"` sections: `dp_size`, `tp_size`, and `pp_size` must match the actual global layout on every node. A3 uses `prefill: dp1 tp4 pp4` on one node and `decode: dp8 tp4 pp1` across two nodes (four local DP ranks per Decode node). 950DT products uses `prefill: dp2 tp4 pp1` and `decode: dp2 tp4 pp1` for two nodes, or `decode: dp4 tp4 pp1` for three nodes."
+msgstr ""
+"- `\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`：使用 Mooncake 作为 prefill 和 decode 节点之间的 KV cache 传输连接器。\n"
+"- `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"` / `\"kv_consumer\"`：prefill 节点上为 `kv_producer`，decode 节点上为 `kv_consumer`。\n"
+"- `\"kv_port\"`：Mooncake KV 传输端口。prefill 和 decode 使用不同的端口。经验证的值是 A3 为 `36000`/`36100`，Ascend 950DT系列产品为 `30000`/`26900`。\n"
+"- `\"use_ascend_direct\": true`：为 KV cache 启用昇腾直接传输。\n"
+"- `\"ascend_local_comm_res_path\": \"/etc/hixlep\"`（仅 Ascend 950DT系列产品）：用于挂载了 `/etc/hixlep/` 的 RoCE 连接的 950DT。在 SuperPod UB 网络上，省略此选项并改为导出 `ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES='{\"version\":\"1.3\"}'`，如第 5.3.1 节模板所示。第 5.3.2 节的 950DT KV-pool 模板保留了静态路径设置；使用 UB 网络时，以相同方式调整 `MultiConnector` 内的 Mooncake 连接器。\n"
+"- `\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"` 部分：`dp_size`、`tp_size` 和 `pp_size` 必须与每个节点上的实际全局布局匹配。A3 在一个节点上使用 `prefill: dp1 tp4 pp4`，在两个节点上使用 `decode: dp8 tp4 pp1`（每个 Decode 节点有四个本地 DP rank）。Ascend 950DT系列产品在两个节点上使用 `prefill: dp2 tp4 pp1` 和 `decode: dp2 tp4 pp1`，或在三个节点上使用 `decode: dp4 tp4 pp1`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"- Wait until Prefill node and DP ranks prints `Application startup complete` before starting the proxy.\n"
+"- The proxy maps every prefill engine endpoint and every decode engine endpoint to a single entry point on port `8009`.\n"
+"- If requests reach the proxy but no output is returned, check that the proxy host list includes every healthy Prefill node and DP ranks, and that all nodes still have free NPU memory after the previous run."
+msgstr ""
+"- 在启动代理之前，等待 Prefill 节点和 DP rank 打印 `Application startup complete`。\n"
+"- 代理将每个 prefill 引擎端点和每个 decode 引擎端点映射到端口 `8009` 上的单一入口点。\n"
+"- 如果请求到达代理但没有返回输出，请检查代理主机列表是否包含每个健康的 Prefill 节点和 DP rank，以及所有节点在之前的运行后是否仍有空闲的 NPU 内存。"
+
+msgid "#### 5.3.2 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation with KV Cache Pool"
+msgstr "#### 5.3.2 使用 KV Cache Pool 的 Prefill-Decode 分离"
+
+msgid ""
+"This section builds on [Section 5.3.1](#531-prefill-decode-disaggregation). "
+"The A3 example uses the same three-node 1P1D topology, "
+"`launch_online_dp.py`, proxy mapping, and MiniMax `vllm serve` settings as "
+"Section 5.3.1 (one P plus two D nodes). The 950DT pool example retains its "
+"two-node 1P1D topology. Prefill and Decode switch to `MultiConnector` so "
+"live P→D KV transfer and Mooncake KV Cache Pool work together:"
+msgstr ""
+"本节建立在[第 5.3.1 节](#531-prefill-decode-disaggregation)的基础上。A3 示例使用与第 5.3.1 "
+"节相同的三节点 1P1D 拓扑、`launch_online_dp.py`、代理映射和 MiniMax `vllm serve` 设置（一个 P "
+"节点加两个 D 节点）。950DT pool 示例保留其两节点 1P1D 拓扑。Prefill 和 Decode 切换到 "
+"`MultiConnector`，以便实时 P→D KV 传输和 Mooncake KV Cache Pool 协同工作："
+
+msgid ""
+"- `MooncakeConnectorV1` transfers KV from Prefill to Decode in real time (same role as Section 5.3.1).\n"
+"- `AscendStoreConnector` stores KV in the Mooncake KV Cache Pool so later Prefills with the same prefix can hit the pool instead of recomputing.\n"
+"- By default the Prefill node performs pool lookup, load, and write."
+msgstr ""
+"- `MooncakeConnectorV1` 将 KV 从 Prefill 实时传输到 Decode（与 5.3.1 节中的作用相同）。\n"
+"- `AscendStoreConnector` 将 KV 存储到 Mooncake KV Cache Pool 中，使后续具有相同前缀的 Prefill 可以命中该池而无需重新计算。\n"
+"- 默认情况下，Prefill 节点执行池查找、加载和写入。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The examples below enable three-tier KV storage: the active NPU KV cache, "
+"the Mooncake memory pool, and SSD offload."
+msgstr "以下示例启用三层 KV 存储：活跃的 NPU KV 缓存、Mooncake 内存池以及 SSD 卸载。"
+
+msgid ""
+"**Compared with normal PD in Section 5.3.1, pay attention to these pooling-"
+"only requirements:**"
+msgstr "**与 5.3.1 节中的普通 PD 相比，请特别注意以下仅池化模式才有的要求：**"
+
+msgid "| Item | Normal PD (5.3.1) | Pooled PD (this section) |"
+msgstr "| 项目 | 普通 PD（5.3.1） | 池化 PD（本节） |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Mooncake Master | Not required | Start `mooncake_master "
+"--enable_offload=true` before Decode / Prefill |"
+msgstr ""
+"| Mooncake Master | 不需要 | 在启动 Decode / Prefill 之前启动 `mooncake_master "
+"--enable_offload=true` |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `mooncake.json` | Not required | Required on every rank; A3 P and both D "
+"nodes use `15GB`; 950DT P and D use `64GB`; enable SSD offload on all nodes "
+"|"
+msgstr ""
+"| `mooncake.json` | 不需要 | 每个 rank 都需要；A3 的 P 和两个 D 节点使用 `15GB`；950DT 的 P 和 D"
+" 使用 `64GB`；在所有节点上启用 SSD 卸载 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Extra env | Section 5.3.1 `HCCL_*` only | Keep 5.3.1 env, then add pool "
+"fabric/UB exports from [KV Cache Pool Deployment "
+"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 额外环境变量 | 仅 5.3.1 节的 `HCCL_*` | 保留 5.3.1 节的环境变量，然后从 [KV Cache Pool "
+"部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) 中添加池化 "
+"fabric/UB 相关导出 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Container mounts | 950DT needs `/etc/hixlep/` | Also mount "
+"`/etc/hccn.conf` and the local SSD offload directory; keep `/etc/hixlep/` on"
+" 950DT |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 容器挂载 | 950DT 需要 `/etc/hixlep/` | 还需挂载 `/etc/hccn.conf` 和本地 SSD 卸载目录；在 "
+"950DT 上保留 `/etc/hixlep/` |"
+
+msgid "##### 5.3.2.1 Prerequisites"
+msgstr "##### 5.3.2.1 前提条件"
+
+msgid ""
+"On 950DT products, also keep the `/etc/hixlep/` mount from Section 5.3.1 for"
+" Ascend direct KV transfer."
+msgstr "在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，还需保留 5.3.1 节中的 `/etc/hixlep/` 挂载，用于昇腾直接 KV 传输。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Use a local SSD directory on each Prefill and Decode host. The examples use "
+"`/nvme/mooncake_offload`; replace it with a directory on the actual SSD "
+"mount. Create it before starting the container:"
+msgstr ""
+"在每个 Prefill 和 Decode 主机上使用本地 SSD 目录。示例中使用 `/nvme/mooncake_offload`；请将其替换为实际 "
+"SSD 挂载点上的目录。在启动容器之前创建该目录："
+
+msgid "Add the corresponding bind mount to every model container:"
+msgstr "为每个模型容器添加相应的绑定挂载："
+
+msgid ""
+"Set `ssd_offload_path` to the absolute directory visible inside the "
+"container and make it writable by the vLLM process. The same path refers to "
+"separate local SSD storage on each host. The backend creates per-rank "
+"subdirectories beneath it. The installed Mooncake package must support the "
+"`enable_ssd_offload` and `ssd_offload_path` arguments in "
+"`MooncakeDistributedStore.setup()`; use the dependencies in the [KV Cache "
+"Pool Deployment "
+"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md)."
+msgstr ""
+"将 `ssd_offload_path` 设置为容器内可见的绝对目录，并确保 vLLM 进程对其具有写权限。同一路径在每台主机上指向各自独立的本地 "
+"SSD 存储。后端会在该目录下创建按 rank 划分的子目录。已安装的 Mooncake 包必须支持 "
+"`MooncakeDistributedStore.setup()` 中的 `enable_ssd_offload` 和 "
+"`ssd_offload_path` 参数；请使用 [KV Cache Pool "
+"部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) 中的依赖。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Place `mooncake.json` next to `run_dp_template.sh` on every node. Use the "
+"same reachable Mooncake Master address and `tenant_id` across P and D. "
+"`global_segment_size` is allocated per worker rank, not per node; a non-zero"
+" value must be aligned to `1GB`. If `MOONCAKE_GLOBAL_SEGMENT_SIZE` is "
+"already exported, update it to the intended size or unset it before startup "
+"because it overrides the JSON value."
+msgstr ""
+"在每个节点上将 `mooncake.json` 放在 `run_dp_template.sh` 旁边。在 P 和 D 上使用相同的可达 Mooncake"
+" Master 地址和 `tenant_id`。`global_segment_size` 按 worker rank "
+"分配，而不是按节点分配；非零值必须按 `1GB` 对齐。如果已导出 "
+"`MOONCAKE_GLOBAL_SEGMENT_SIZE`，请将其更新为预期大小，或在启动前取消设置，因为它会覆盖 JSON 中的值。"
+
+msgid ""
+"A3 `mooncake.json` on P, first D and second D (replace "
+"`<MOONCAKE_MASTER_IP>` with the actual Master IP):"
+msgstr ""
+"A3 上 P、第一个 D 和第二个 D 的 `mooncake.json`（将 `<MOONCAKE_MASTER_IP>` 替换为实际的 Master"
+" IP）："
+
+msgid ""
+"The A3 example uses `15GB` per worker rank on P and both D nodes. Adjust "
+"this value to each machine's available allocatable memory and fragmentation "
+"after reserving memory for vLLM and other processes. Allow additional space "
+"for the SSD I/O buffer and allocation headroom, and account for all "
+"contributing worker ranks on the node."
+msgstr ""
+"A3 示例在 P 和两个 D 节点上为每个 worker rank 使用 `15GB`。在为 vLLM "
+"和其他进程预留内存后，请根据每台机器的可用可分配内存和碎片情况调整此值。为 SSD I/O 缓冲区和分配余量预留额外空间，并考虑节点上所有参与贡献的 "
+"worker rank。"
+
+msgid "950DT Prefill `mooncake.json` (replace `<MOONCAKE_MASTER_IP>`):"
+msgstr "950DT Prefill 的 `mooncake.json`（替换 `<MOONCAKE_MASTER_IP>`）："
+
+msgid ""
+"950DT Decode `mooncake.json` (same Master and `tenant_id`; both P and D "
+"contribute memory and enable SSD offload):"
+msgstr ""
+"950DT Decode 的 `mooncake.json`（相同的 Master 和 `tenant_id`；P 和 D 均贡献内存并启用 SSD "
+"卸载）："
+
+msgid ""
+"The 950DT examples use `64GB` per worker rank on both P and D. Adjust the "
+"size to the actual available memory and fragmentation on each machine rather"
+" than treating `64GB` as a fixed requirement. Budget for all worker ranks on"
+" the node, SSD I/O buffers, and other allocations; reduce the segment size "
+"if the machine cannot register the requested memory."
+msgstr ""
+"950DT 示例在 P 和 D 上为每个 worker rank 使用 `64GB`。请根据每台机器的实际可用内存和碎片情况调整大小，而不要将 "
+"`64GB` 视为固定要求。为节点上的所有 worker rank、SSD I/O 缓冲区和其他分配预留预算；如果机器无法注册所请求的内存，请减小 "
+"segment 大小。"
