+"according to your machine and link type."
+msgstr ""
+"从 5.3.1 节的环境变量块开始（`HCCL_IF_IP`、`HCCL`/`GLOO` socket "
+"IFNAME、`HCCL_BUFFSIZE`、`HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE`、`PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF`、`ASCEND_RT_VISIBLE_DEVICES`，以及"
+" A3 Prefill 的 "
+"`VLLM_PP_LAYER_PARTITION=\"16,15,15,14\"`）。然后添加下面池化所需的变量。请根据您的机器和链路类型，从 "
+"[环境变量说明](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) "
