+msgid "#### 9.2.2 Workload-Specific Tuning"
+msgstr "#### 9.2.2 针对特定工作负载的调优"
+
+msgid ""
+"Use the following adjustments as starting points for the target workload. "
+"Recheck memory usage, latency, and throughput after each change."
+msgstr "可将以下调整作为目标工作负载的起点。每次更改后请重新检查内存使用、延迟和吞吐量。"
+
+msgid "| Scenario | Parameter | Example Adjustment | Tuning Goal |"
+msgstr "| 场景 | 参数 | 调整示例 | 调优目标 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Device-memory-bound workloads where KV cache capacity limits concurrency |"
+" `HCCL_BUFFSIZE` | Reduce from `2048` to `1024` (MB). | Reduce HCCL "
+"communication-buffer memory usage to make more device memory available for "
+"KV cache and allow higher concurrency. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 受设备内存限制、KV 缓存容量制约并发度的工作负载 | `HCCL_BUFFSIZE` | 从 `2048` 降低到 `1024`（MB）。 | "
+"减少 HCCL 通信缓冲区内存占用，为 KV 缓存腾出更多设备内存，从而支持更高的并发度。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"| Short-input workloads, such as 4K input tokens | `--max-num-batched-"
+"tokens` | Reduce from `32768` to `8192`. | Use a smaller per-iteration token"
+" budget to reduce memory pressure and tune short-sequence performance. |"
+msgstr ""
+"| 短输入工作负载，例如 4K 输入 token | `--max-num-batched-tokens` | 从 `32768` 降低到 "
+"`8192`。 | 使用更小的单次迭代 token 预算以降低内存压力，并调优短序列性能。 |"
