 msgid ""
-"MRv2 supports asynchronous EPLB only and normalizes `use_async=false` to\n"
-"    asynchronous movement. It rejects elastic EP, legacy `dynamic_eplb`,\n"
-"    recording/static-map fields, `DYNAMIC_EPLB`, and `EXPERT_MAP_RECORD`, as\n"
-"    well as communicators other than Gloo and HIXL. HIXL requires the CANN HIXL\n"
-"    runtime and working device connectivity on every EPLB rank. Validate the\n"
-"    target model, topology, graph mode, and traffic independently before\n"
-"    production use."
+"Expert balancing for MoE (Mixture of Experts) models in LLM (Large Language Model) serving is essential for optimal performance.\n"
+"Dynamically rearranging experts during inference can negatively impact TTFT (Time To First Token) and TPOT (Time Per Output Token), as it requires global synchronization pauses that stall all in-flight requests.\n"
+"Our solution aims to minimize the impact of these pauses.\n"
+"vLLM Ascend provides two EPLB integration paths:"
+msgstr ""
+"在 LLM（大语言模型）推理服务中，针对 MoE（混合专家）模型的专家均衡对于获得最优性能至关重要。\n"
+"在推理过程中动态重排专家会对 TTFT（首 token 时延）和 TPOT（每输出 token 时延）产生负面影响，因为这需要全局同步暂停，从而阻塞所有正在处理的请求。\n"
+"我们的方案旨在尽量降低这些暂停带来的影响。\n"
+"vLLM Ascend 提供两种 EPLB 集成路径："
+
+msgid ""
+"950PR&950DT Products does not support using EPLB with quant type \"W4A8MXFP4\", \"W4A16MXFP4\".\n"
+"    A2 does not support redundant experts. On A2, `num_redundant_experts` must be set to `0`. Examples using a non-zero `num_redundant_experts` apply only to hardware that supports redundant experts, such as A3 or 950PR&950DT Products."
+msgstr ""
+"Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品不支持在量化类型为 \"W4A8MXFP4\"、\"W4A16MXFP4\" 时使用 EPLB。\n"
+"    A2 不支持冗余专家。在 A2 上，`num_redundant_experts` 必须设置为 `0`。使用非零 `num_redundant_experts` 的示例仅适用于支持冗余专家的硬件，例如 A3 或 Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品。"
+
+msgid ""
+"The following table summarizes the code paths supported by MRv2 EPLB. W8A8 "
+"is covered by an in-repository model-level regression test that runs on "
+"Ascend NPUs. Other enabled formats have not undergone the same level of "
+"validation and must be validated with the target model and hardware "
+"configuration before production deployment."
+msgstr ""
+"下表汇总了 MRv2 EPLB 支持的代码路径。W8A8 由仓库内运行的模型级回归测试覆盖，该测试在昇腾 NPU "
+"上执行。其他已启用的格式尚未经过同等程度的验证，在生产部署前必须使用目标模型和硬件配置进行验证。"
+
+msgid "!!!NOTE"
+msgstr "!!!NOTE"
+
+msgid ""
+"The examples below may use a non-zero `num_redundant_experts` to demonstrate"
+" redundant-expert placement. This setting is only valid on hardware that "
+"supports redundant experts, such as A3 or 950PR&950DT Products. A2 does not "
+"support redundant experts; on A2, set `num_redundant_experts` to `0`."
+msgstr ""
+"以下示例可能使用非零的 `num_redundant_experts` 来演示冗余专家的放置。该设置仅在支持冗余专家的硬件上有效，例如 A3 或 "
+"Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品。A2 不支持冗余专家；在 A2 上，请将 `num_redundant_experts` 设置为 `0`。"
+
+msgid ""
+"| `num_redundant_experts` | `0` | Number of redundant physical experts. Must"
+" be `0` on A2. |"
+msgstr "| `num_redundant_experts` | `0` | 冗余物理专家的数量。在 A2 上必须为 `0`。 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"MRv2 supports asynchronous EPLB only and normalizes `use_async=false` to asynchronous movement.\n"
+"    It rejects elastic EP, legacy `dynamic_eplb`, recording/static-map fields, `DYNAMIC_EPLB`, and `EXPERT_MAP_RECORD`, as well as communicators other than Gloo and HIXL.\n"
+"    HIXL requires the CANN HIXL runtime and working device connectivity on every EPLB rank.\n"
+"    Validate the target model, topology, graph mode, and traffic independently before production use."
+msgstr ""
+"MRv2 仅支持异步 EPLB，并将 `use_async=false` 规范化为异步迁移。\n"
+"    它会拒绝弹性 EP、旧版 `dynamic_eplb`、录制/静态映射字段、`DYNAMIC_EPLB` 和 `EXPERT_MAP_RECORD`，以及除 Gloo 和 HIXL 之外的通信器。\n"
+"    HIXL 需要 CANN HIXL 运行时，并且每个 EPLB rank 上的设备连接均正常工作。\n"
+"    在生产使用前，请独立验证目标模型、拓扑、图模式和流量。"
+
+msgid ""
+"For Dynamic EPLB and Recording modes, the env variable acts as a safety guard: setting `dynamic_eplb: true` in config alone is not enough — the assertion requires `DYNAMIC_EPLB=true` or `EXPERT_MAP_RECORD=true`.\n"
+"    Static EPLB (loading a pre-recorded map via `expert_map_path`) does **not** require an env variable."
+msgstr ""
+"对于动态 EPLB 和录制模式，环境变量起到安全防护作用：仅在配置中设置 `dynamic_eplb: true` 是不够的——断言要求 `DYNAMIC_EPLB=true` 或 `EXPERT_MAP_RECORD=true`。\n"
+"    静态 EPLB（通过 `expert_map_path` 加载预先录制的映射）**不**需要环境变量。"
+
+msgid ""
+"| num_redundant_experts | Number of redundant experts. Must be `0` on A2. | "
+"0 |"
+msgstr "| num_redundant_experts | 冗余专家的数量。在 A2 上必须为 `0`。 | 0 |"
+
+msgid ""
+"This section describes the MRv1-only `eplb_heat_collection_stage` field.\n"
+"    MRv2 uses `load_collection_phase` as described above; the two fields have different batch-classification semantics and are not interchangeable."
 msgstr ""
-"MRv2 仅支持异步 EPLB，并将 `use_async=false` 规范化为异步迁移。它拒绝弹性 EP、旧版 "
-"`dynamic_eplb`、记录/静态映射字段、`DYNAMIC_EPLB` 和 `EXPERT_MAP_RECORD`，以及除 Gloo 和 "
-"HIXL 之外的通信器。HIXL 要求每个 EPLB rank 上具备 CANN HIXL "
-"运行时和正常工作的设备连接。在生产使用前，请独立验证目标模型、拓扑、图模式和流量。"
+"本节介绍仅 MRv1 支持的 `eplb_heat_collection_stage` 字段。\n"
+"    MRv2 使用上文所述的 `load_collection_phase`；这两个字段具有不同的批次分类语义，不可互换。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Stage selection applies to dynamic EPLB heat collection. Internally, vLLM-"
+"Ascend classifies each forward iteration by comparing its padded scheduled "
+"token count with the maximum expected token count of a decode iteration. An "
+"iteration above the threshold is treated as prefill; an iteration at or "
+"below the threshold is treated as decode. Classification is therefore "
+"performed per forward iteration rather than per individual request."
+msgstr ""
+"阶段选择适用于动态 EPLB 热度收集。在内部，vLLM-Ascend 通过将每次前向迭代的填充后调度 token 数与解码迭代的最大预期 token "
+"数进行比较来对迭代进行分类。高于阈值的迭代被视为 prefill；等于或低于阈值的迭代被视为 "
+"decode。因此，分类是按每次前向迭代执行的，而不是按单个请求执行的。"
+
+msgid "Static EPLB is scheduled for removal in v0.25.1."
+msgstr "静态 EPLB 计划在 v0.25.1 中移除。"
