+msgid "### Mooncake Layerwise Pooling"
+msgstr "### Mooncake 分层池化"
+
+msgid ""
+"Layerwise pooling is supported with KVPP for the Mooncake block-key data "
+"plane. Each TP rank owns a contiguous share of the layers, loads only those "
+"layers from the pool, and the KVPP broadcast supplies the other ranks when a"
+" layer executes. `layerwise_prefetch_layers` sets the prefetch distance: the"
+" load of layer `L` is submitted at model layer `max(0, L - "
+"layerwise_prefetch_layers)`."
+msgstr ""
+"Mooncake block-key 数据平面通过 KVPP 支持分层池化。每个 TP rank "
+"拥有一段连续的层，仅从池中加载这些层，当某一层执行时，由 KVPP 广播为其他 rank "
+"提供数据。`layerwise_prefetch_layers` 设置预取距离：层 `L` 的加载在模型层 `max(0, L - "
+"layerwise_prefetch_layers)` 处提交。"
+
+msgid ""
+"Configure Mooncake as described in the [Mooncake layerwise "
+"guide](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md), then add:"
+msgstr ""
+"按照 [Mooncake 分层指南](mooncake_layerwise_adaptation_and_optimization.md) 中的说明配置"
+" Mooncake，然后添加："
+
+msgid ""
+"Mooncake layerwise pooling requires `load_async=false` (loads are submitted "
+"layer by layer) and does not enable cross-layer reuse of persistent owner "
+"caches. It was validated on a single node with TP8, Model Runner V2, and "
+"eager execution; PP, PCP, and DCP were not part of that validation."
+msgstr ""
+"Mooncake 分层池化要求 `load_async=false`（加载逐层提交），并且不会启用持久化 owner 缓存的跨层复用。它已在单节点上使用"
+" TP8、Model Runner V2 和 eager 执行完成验证；PP、PCP 和 DCP 不在该验证范围内。"
